      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"option to automatically block avatars with worse performance rating than currently worn avatar\"\n\n\"Dynamically change avatar performancelevel requirements based on worn avatar\"\n\nI wonder about like a big crowd mode, where it changes the performance rating and has an avatar chosen, then when you turn it off, it has option to change your avatar back as well.\n\nHaving the game react to every avatar change could be risky if you're avatar browsing. Load into an avid that is excellent and now it unloads the friends, then when you choose very poor Avi it loads them back in.",
