  "details": "An option to toggle a feature which will automatically change the option: \"Block Poorly Optimized Avatars\" based on your currently worn avatar. For example if your currently worn avatar is Very Poor it'll set it to \"Don't block\". If it's medium, green or poor it'll set it to \"Poor and bellow\". I think this will be pretty useful when getting ready to join a 80 player lobby.",
